    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a test subject tasked with testing out a new experimental device capable of changing the gravitational pull of any objects it is used on. Your mission is to complete a series of tests designed to challenge the capabilities of the device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The device allows you to change the gravitational pull of yourself, allowing you to &quot;fall&quot; in any direction you please. Similarly, you can use this device on other objects as well, which allows you to send any object flying into whatever direction you please.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the tests, the Overseer will monitor your progress and talk to you as you play.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a test subject tasked with testing out a new experimental device capable of changing the gravitational pull of any objects it is used on. Your mission is to complete a series of tests designed to challenge the capabilities of the device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The device allows you to change the gravitational pull of yourself, allowing you to &quot;fall&quot; in any direction you please. Similarly, you can use this device on other objects as well, which allows you to send any object flying into whatever direction you please.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the tests, the Overseer will monitor your progress and talk to you as you play.</p>",
